  "executive_briefing": "The mid-2026 crypto landscape is structurally pivoting around the legislative acceleration of the Digital Asset Market CLARITY Act, which cleared the Senate Banking Committee in May 2026. This regulatory shift is unlocking institutional-grade smart contract deployment and accelerating the evolution of Bitcoin from a passive ETF-dominated asset into a programmable utility layer. With US spot Bitcoin ETFs consolidating over $130 billion in assets and corporate treasuries scaling exposure, native DeFi architectures are rapidly displacing insecure wrapped assets. Enhanced non-custodial cross-chain swap infrastructures are enabling direct, bridgeless liquidity transfers between Bitcoin and EVM networks, establishing a credible, long-term challenge to Ethereum's historical dominance in decentralized finance execution.",
